              "If found to be a confirmed distress, follow procedures as described in Section 4. Rowing Boat Emergency",
              "If not able to confirm false activation within 20 minutes: 8.1.5.1 Inform NMOC of no immediate response from rowing boat and offer communication assistance. NMOC to co- ordinate all further actions 8.1.5.2 Follow procedures as described in Section 4. Rowing Boat Emergency"
