              "Safety Vessel to notify Safety Officer immediately if contact is made with Rowing Boat and distress situation is established.",
              "Safety Vessel(s) to alter course to rowing boats last know position and await further instruction from Safety Officer",
              "If found to be a confirmed distress or unable to confirm false activation within 20 minutes, Safety Vessel(s) to follow procedures as described in Section 4.4 Safety Vessel Actions"
