              "If unable to contact Safety Officer, contact NMOC and inform them.",
              "If you are unsure whether you have activated your EPIRB and you are not in distress, contact the SO or NMOC to check.",
              "If unable to contact Safety Officer or NMOC, contact RHQ and inform them.",
              "If unable to contact Safety Officer, NMOC or Race Headquarters, try any other means of communications (VHF to any vessel in range, other comms systems, etc.) if all communications have failed, continue to row as normal. The progress indicated by the satellite tracker will give some indication to the Safety Officer that you are not in distress.",
